# D1: a breakpoint on a line, the stack, a step over, a step in and out, the frames walked.
# After the step into `twice` only the parameter is read: lldb stops past the prologue on line 2
# and cdb on the function's own line 1, so a local is not yet set under one of them.
break @:9
run
bt
vars
next
step
bt
print n
up
vars
down
finish
continue
